<tr><td class='word'>wolf</td><td class='phonetic'>/wulf/ <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('wolf')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 狼, 残忍贪婪之人, 极度穷困</td><td class='def-en'>any of various predatory carnivorous canine mammals of North America and Eurasia that usually hunt in packs</td><td>4.35</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_0' data-word="wolf" src='images/wolf.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('wolf', 'animals', 'img_0')" title='不满意？点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
