<tr><td class='word'>marmot</td><td class='phonetic'>/'mɑ:mәt/ <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('marmot')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 土拨鼠</td><td class='def-en'>stocky coarse-furred burrowing rodent with a short bushy tail found throughout the northern hemisphere; hibernates in winter</td><td>2.4</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_684' data-word="marmot" src='images/marmot.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('marmot', 'animals', 'img_684')" title='不满意？点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'>silkworm</td><td class='phonetic'>/'silkwә:m/ <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('silkworm')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 蚕</td><td class='def-en'>the commercially bred hairless white caterpillar of the domestic silkworm moth which spins a cocoon that can be processed to yield silk fiber; the principal source of commercial silk</td><td>2.4</td><td><div class='img-box'><img id='img_685' data-word="silkworm" src='images/silkworm.jpg' loading='lazy'/><button class='swap-btn' onclick="swapImage('silkworm', 'animals', 'img_685')" title='不满意？点击切换下一张图'>🔄 换图</button></div></td></tr>
